 3}, {"showAdvanced": true, "outputs": [{"name": "width", "links": [13], "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"name": "height", "links": [14], "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}], "widgets_values": ["9:16 (Portrait Widescreen)", 1.6, 16], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "preview", "label": "preview", "type": "RESOLUTION_PREVIEW", "localized_name": "preview"}, {"widget": {"name": "aspect_ratio"}, "name": "aspect_ratio", "label": "aspect_ratio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "aspect_ratio"}, {"widget": {"name": "megapixels"}, "name": "megapixels", "label": "megapixels", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "megapixels"}, {"widget": {"name": "multiple"}, "name": "multiple", "label": "multiple", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "multiple"}], "flags": {}, "type": "ResolutionSelector", "title": "画幅比例 / 分辨率", "mode": 0, "size": [320, 170], "pos": [840, 560], "id": 14, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ResolutionSelector"}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["## 发布参数对照（内部用）\n\n| 节点 | 参数 | 表单名称建议 | 控件 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 14 ResolutionSelector | `aspect_ratio` | 画幅比例/方向 | 下拉 |\n| 14 ResolutionSelector | `megapixels` | 分辨率/总像素 | 下拉或数值 |\n| 5 CLIPTextEncode | `text` | 提示词 | 多行文本 |\n| 7 EmptyLatentImage | `batch_size` | 一次出图数量 | 数值 1~9 |\n| 8 KSampler | `seed` | 随机种子 | 数值 |\n| 8 KSampler | `steps` | 采样步数 | 数值（默认 8） |\n| 4 主lora | `lora_name` / `strength_model` | 主lora / 主lora强度 | 下拉 + 数值 |\n| 13 副lora | `lora_name` / `strength_model` | 副lora / 副lora强度 | 下拉 + 数值 |\n| 16 副lora开关 | `boolean` | 启用副lora | 开关（默认 OFF） |\n\n**锁定项**：1/2/3 号模型文件名、14 号 `multiple=16`、8 号 `cfg=1`、采样器 `euler`、调度器 `simple`、`denoise=1`、9/10 号解码与输出。\n\n**默认值**：9:16 + 1.6MP + 16 对齐 = 976×1728，一次出 9 张。\n\n**常用档位（16 对齐实际输出）**\n\n| 比例 | 1.6MP | 2K 档 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 9:16 竖屏 | 976×1728 | 1440×2560（3.5MP） |\n| 3:4 竖图 | 1120×1488 | 1920×2560（4.7MP） |\n| 1:1 方形 | 1296×1296 | 2048×2048（4.0MP） |\n| 16:9 横图 | 1728×976 | 2560×1440（3.5MP） |\n\n9 张同批时，单张建议 ≤2.5MP。\n\n**发布前确认**：副lora 默认文件 `Krea2-美女72-极简高级美人-10000.safetensors` 需在 RH 的 LoRA 列表里选得到——它只在「启用副lora」打开时才会被加载，默认关闭状态不受影响。\n\n**基座切换（备用）**：换 Krea 2 RAW 时约 28~30 步、CFG 3~4，并替换 1/2/3 号模型文件。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "发布参数对照（内部）", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [1200, 380], "pos": [620, 1240], "id": 15, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 5}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "pixaromaGroups": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "ds": {"offset": [-282.9920595987365, -118.2352145689291], "scale": 1.744067627421632}}, "groups": [{"color": "#d94a8a", "font_size": 20, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "Krea2 Turbo + LoRA 文生图 · 真实人像（参照 ZImage真实人像）", "bounding": [80, 60, 3400, 1240]}], "links": [[1, 1, 0, 4, 0, "MODEL"], [2, 4, 0, 13, 0, "MODEL"], [3, 2, 0, 5, 0, "CLIP"], [4, 5, 0, 8, 1, "CONDITIONING"], [5, 5, 0, 6, 0, "CONDITIONING"], [6, 6, 0, 8, 2, "CONDITIONING"], [7, 7, 0, 8, 3, "LATENT"], [8, 8, 0, 9, 0, "LATENT"], [9, 3, 0, 9, 1, "VAE"], [10, 9, 0, 10, 0, "IMAGE"], [11, 9, 0, 12, 0, "IMAGE"], [12, 13, 0, 16, 0, "MODEL"], [13, 14, 0, 7, 0, "INT"], [14, 14, 1, 7, 1, "INT"], [15, 4, 0, 16, 1, "MODEL"], [16, 16, 0, 8, 0, "MODEL"]], "id": "krea2-real-portrait", "config": {}, "version": 0.4, "last_node_id": 16, "revision": 0}